<script setup lang="ts">import { computed,onMounted,ref,watch } from 'vue';import { useRoute } from 'vue-router';import { useSystemStore } from '../stores/system';import Panel from '../components/Panel.vue';import StatusBadge from '../components/StatusBadge.vue';const s=useSystemStore(),route=useRoute(),symbol=ref(String(route.query.symbol??s.pool[0]?.symbol??'BTCUSDT'));onMounted(()=>s.loadEip(symbol.value));watch(symbol,v=>s.loadEip(v));const e=computed<any>(()=>s.selectedEip),fmt=(v:any)=>v==null||v==='—'?'未接入':typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(6):String(v),band=(v:any)=>Array.isArray(v)?`${fmt(v[0])} – ${fmt(v[1])}`:'未接入',macdBias=(t:any)=>typeof t?.macdLine==='number'&&typeof t?.macdSignal==='number'&&typeof t?.macdHistogram==='number'?(t.macdLine<t.macdSignal&&t.macdHistogram<0?'BEARISH':t.macdLine>t.macdSignal&&t.macdHistogram>0?'BULLISH':'MIXED'):'UNAVAILABLE';
</script>
<template><div class="page-stack"><div class="toolbar"><div><span class="eyebrow">ENTRY INTELLIGENCE PACKET</span><h2 class="page-title">市场智能</h2></div><select v-model="symbol" class="select"><option v-for="p in s.pool" :key="p.symbol" :value="p.symbol">{{p.symbol}}</option><option v-if="!s.pool.some(p=>p.symbol===symbol)" :value="symbol">{{symbol}}</option></select></div><template v-if="e"><Panel title="候选概况" :subtitle="`${e.symbol} · ${e.packetId}`"><div class="facts wide"><div><dt>Symbol / Rank</dt><dd>{{e.symbol}} / {{e.selection?.rank??'未知'}}</dd></div><div><dt>Score / Pool</dt><dd>{{fmt(e.selection?.score)}} / {{e.selection?.selectionMode??'未知'}}</dd></div><div><dt>Selection Reason</dt><dd>流动性、活跃度、技术机会与执行可达性综合排序</dd></div><div><dt>15m 主方向</dt><dd><StatusBadge :value="e.market?.technical?.['15m']?.trend??'未知'"/></dd></div></div></Panel><Panel title="价格与盘口"><div class="kpi-grid four"><div class="kpi"><span>Last / Mark</span><strong>{{fmt(e.market?.quote?.last)}} / {{fmt(e.market?.quote?.mark)}}</strong></div><div class="kpi"><span>Bid / Ask / Spread</span><strong>{{fmt(e.market?.quote?.bid)}} / {{fmt(e.market?.quote?.ask)}} / {{fmt(e.microstructure?.spreadBps)}} bps</strong></div><div class="kpi"><span>Imbalance / Microprice</span><strong>{{fmt(e.microstructure?.imbalance)}} / {{fmt(e.microstructure?.microPrice)}}</strong></div><div class="kpi"><span>Reachable Range</span><strong>{{band(e.microstructure?.reachableBand1m)}} / {{band(e.microstructure?.reachableBand5m)}}</strong></div></div></Panel><Panel title="多周期技术指标" subtitle="Trend = EMA 结构综合；MACD 独立显示动量，二者冲突时不表述为单一看涨/看跌"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>周期</th><th>EMA 结构趋势</th><th>EMA 8 / 21 / 55</th><th>MACD 线 / 信号 / 柱体</th><th>MACD 动量</th><th>Bollinger</th><th>ATR</th><th>Swing</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="tf in ['1m','5m','15m','4h','1d','1w']" :key="tf"><td><strong>{{tf}}{{tf==='15m'?' · 主方向':''}}</strong></td><td>{{e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.trend??'未知'}}</td><td>{{fmt(e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.ema8)}} / {{fmt(e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.ema21)}} / {{fmt(e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.ema55)}}</td><td>{{fmt(e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.macdLine)}} / {{fmt(e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.macdSignal)}} / {{fmt(e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.macdHistogram)}}</td><td>{{macdBias(e.market?.technical?.[tf])}} · {{e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.macdCrossDirection??'NONE'}}</td><td>{{fmt(e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.bbUpper)}} / {{fmt(e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.bbLower)}}</td><td>{{fmt(e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.atr14)}}</td><td>{{fmt(e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.swingHigh)}} / {{fmt(e.market?.technical?.[tf]?.swingLow)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></Panel><div class="grid-2"><Panel title="Portfolio"><div class="facts"><div><dt>持仓 / 待成交</dt><dd>{{e.portfolio?.activePositions??0}} / {{e.portfolio?.pendingEntries??0}}</dd></div><div><dt>多空持仓</dt><dd>{{e.portfolio?.longPositions??0}} / {{e.portfolio?.shortPositions??0}}</dd></div><div><dt>多头盈利比例</dt><dd>{{e.portfolio?.longProfitableRatio==null?'未知':`${(e.portfolio.longProfitableRatio*100).toFixed(1)}%`}}</dd></div><div><dt>空头盈利比例</dt><dd>{{e.portfolio?.shortProfitableRatio==null?'未知':`${(e.portfolio.shortProfitableRatio*100).toFixed(1)}%`}}</dd></div></div></Panel><Panel title="Experience"><div class="facts"><div><dt>样本数</dt><dd>{{e.experience?.sampleSize??0}}</dd></div><div><dt>同 Symbol 胜率</dt><dd>{{e.experience?.sameSymbolWinRate==null?'未知':`${(e.experience.sameSymbolWinRate*100).toFixed(1)}%`}}</dd></div><div><dt>同 Regime 胜率</dt><dd>{{e.experience?.sameRegimeWinRate==null?'未知':`${(e.experience.sameRegimeWinRate*100).toFixed(1)}%`}}</dd></div><div><dt>平均成交等待</dt><dd>{{e.experience?.averageFillMinutes==null?'未知':`${e.experience.averageFillMinutes.toFixed(1)}m`}}</dd></div></div><ul class="bullet-list"><li v-for="lesson in e.experience?.recentLessons??[]" :key="lesson">{{lesson}}</li></ul></Panel></div><Panel title="衍生品与证据质量"><div class="facts wide"><div><dt>OI</dt><dd>{{fmt(e.market?.derivatives?.openInterest)}}</dd></div><div><dt>Funding</dt><dd>{{fmt(e.market?.derivatives?.fundingRate)}}</dd></div><div><dt>Taker</dt><dd>{{fmt(e.market?.derivatives?.takerBuySellRatio)}}</dd></div><div><dt>Long / Short</dt><dd>{{fmt(e.market?.derivatives?.longShortRatio)}}</dd></div><div><dt>BTC / ETH Regime</dt><dd>{{e.globalRegime?.regime??'未知'}}</dd></div><div><dt>证据完整度</dt><dd>{{e.evidenceCompleteness==null?'未知':`${(e.evidenceCompleteness*100).toFixed(0)}%`}}</dd></div><div><dt>Contradictions</dt><dd>{{(e.contradictions??[]).join('；')||'无'}}</dd></div><div><dt>Missing Evidence</dt><dd>{{(e.market?.derivatives?.openInterest==null?'衍生品数据未接入':'无')}}</dd></div></div></Panel><details><summary>原始审计 JSON</summary><pre class="mono">{{JSON.stringify(e,null,2)}}</pre></details></template><Panel v-else title="EIP 状态"><div class="empty"><StatusBadge :value="s.eipState?.status??'RECOVERING'"/><p>{{s.eipState?.reason??'等待市场数据恢复'}}</p></div></Panel></div></template>


